  "content": "<h1><strong>Keerdm 的殭屍啟示錄必備</strong></h1><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_737e5d99-63b4-4dcb-bc66-d0236240fd81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"2\"></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkeerdm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e1176f98-5369-4e03-82b3-c78a7931710c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"138\"></span></a></h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_11a36afe-b55c-474a-ab88-d6a844121e5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"2\"></p><h2><strong>使用說明</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e5481172-ddee-46b4-820b-de6c45e7b637.png\"></p><p>（使用說明中唯一必要的步驟是按下「自訂」，然後將世界風格從「標準」改為 keerdm_zombie_essentials:testworld。）</p><h3><strong>若要獲得圖庫圖片中顯示的結果，請選擇 talluildings 預設。</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>請在發表評論或提問前仔細閱讀完整說明！</strong></span></h1><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>如果你安裝了這個模組且沒有遵循指示，請不要在 Lost Cities 的 GitHub 上回報問題！！！！</strong></span></h1><p>這個模組非常適合喜歡<strong>殭屍啟示錄模組包</strong>的玩家。它修改了來自<strong>The Lost Cities</strong>的建築，賦予它們<strong>末日後</strong>的外觀。</p><p><strong>歡迎在留言區留下任何建議或問題！(:</strong></p><h2><strong>特色：</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>修改後的城市</strong>，帶來末日後體驗</li>\n<li><strong>廢棄的電線桿</strong></li>\n<li>更好的<strong>小屋</strong></li>\n<li>增強的<strong>無線電塔</strong></li>\n<li>高速公路上的<strong>廢棄車輛</strong></li>\n<li>散落在各地的<strong>風力發電機</strong></li>\n<li>城市戰利品箱中的<strong>可拾取槍枝和彈藥</strong>（<strong>可選</strong>）</li>\n</ul><p><strong>此模組需要：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>Immersive Weathering</strong></li>\n<li><strong>The Lost Cities</strong></li>\n<li>可選：<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong>、<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong> 或 <strong>Timeless and Classics (TAC)</strong></li>\n</ul><p>從 <strong>v1.1（支援 TACZ）</strong>或 <strong>v1.2（支援 Vic's Point Blank）</strong>開始，<strong>槍枝和彈藥</strong>會生成在城市戰利品箱中，增加沉浸感。</p><h3><strong>v1.4 新增內容：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>高速公路上有廢棄車輛</strong></li>\n<li><strong>風力發電機</strong>已添加至環境中</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>槍枝模組支援：</strong></h3><p>v1.2 之後的版本將包含兩個獨立版本：</p><ul>\n<li>支援 <strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong> 的版本</li>\n<li>支援 <strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong> 的版本</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>相容性：</strong></h2><table style=\"width:70.516%;border-width:3px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">版本</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.20.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.2</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.3</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.4</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>版本功能：</strong></h2><table style=\"width:81.5381%;border-width:3px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>版本</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.0</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.1</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.3</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.4+</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>磚造建築</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>石造建築</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>電線桿</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:9.40505%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">